{"unit_id":"tag:094H:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为诺特环（Noetherian ring）。\n设 <MATH_0003>。若\n<MATH_0004> 与 <MATH_0005> 的上同调层（cohomology sheaves）为局部常值（locally constant）的 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）的层（sheaves），\n且为有限型（finite type），则\n<MATH_0007>\n的上同调层（cohomology sheaves）为局部常值（locally constant）的 <MATH_0008>-模（modules）的层（sheaves），且为有限型（finite type）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"基"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"输入与结论"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"上同调条件"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"上同调条件"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:094H:proof","translation":"我们将把它作为引理 <REF_0001> 的应用来证明。\n注意 <MATH_0001> 与\n<MATH_0002> 相同。\n因此可假设 <MATH_0003> 和 <MATH_0004> 有界（bounded）。由\n引理 <REF_0002>，\n可假设 <MATH_0005> 和 <MATH_0006> 由复形（complexes）表示，\n其各项为局部常值（locally constant）的 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）的层（sheaves），\n且为有限型（finite type）。于是可将这些复形（complexes）换为\n上有界（bounded above）的复形（complexes），其各项为有限自由（finite free）<MATH_0008>-模（modules）。\n在这种情形下，结论是显然的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"bounded","target_term":"有界","context":"输入复形"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"局部表示"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"各项"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"表示各项"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界","context":"自由表示"},{"source_term":"finite free","target_term":"有限自由","context":"表示各项"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:094I:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为诺特环（Noetherian ring）。\n设 <MATH_0003> 为理想（ideal）。\n设 <MATH_0004>。若\n<MATH_0005> 的上同调层（cohomology sheaves）为局部常值（locally constant）的\n<MATH_0006>-模（modules）的层（sheaves），且为有限型（finite type），则\n<MATH_0007>\n的上同调层（cohomology sheaves）对所有\n<MATH_0009> 均为局部常值（locally constant）的 <MATH_0008>-模（modules）的层（sheaves），且为有限型（finite type）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"基"},{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"诺特环","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"输入"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"输入与结论"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"上同调条件"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"上同调条件"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:094I:proof","translation":"回顾一下，局部常值（locally constant）的 <MATH_0001>-模（modules）的层（sheaves），若为有限型（finite type），\n则在所有 <MATH_0002>-模（modules）中构成弱 Serre 子范畴（weak Serre subcategory），参见\n位点上的模（Modules on Sites），引理\n<REF_0001>。\n因此，<MATH_0003> 的子范畴（subcategory），其对象为\n上同调层（cohomology sheaves）是局部常值（locally constant）的\n<MATH_0004>-模（modules）的层（sheaves）且为有限型（finite type）的复形（complexes），构成\n<MATH_0005> 的严格全（strictly full）、饱和（saturated）的三角（triangulated）子范畴（subcategory），参见\n导出范畴（Derived Categories），引理 <REF_0002>。\n接着，考虑区别三角（distinguished triangles）\n<MATH_0006>\n以及同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0007>。\n结合引理 <REF_0003>，\n我们得到结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"weak Serre subcategory","target_term":"弱 Serre 子范畴"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"位点上的模"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"strictly full","target_term":"严格全"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和"},{"source_term":"triangulated","target_term":"三角"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"有限型条件"},{"source_term":"finite type","ta